Package: parrot-menu
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, pkexec, xdg-utils, libc6
Suggests: parrot-menu-security
Breaks: dradis (<< 3.1.0~rc2),
        parrot-menu-security (<< ${source:Version})
Replaces: mate-menus,
          libgarcon-common,
          parrot-menu-security (<< ${source:Version})
Description: Parrot GNU/Linux custom menu
 This package provides the menu infrastructure and complete launcher catalog
 for Parrot GNU/Linux.
 .
 It is used by any desktop that complies with the Freedesktop menu
 specification at http://standards.freedesktop.org/menu-spec/menu-spec-1.0.html

Package: parrot-menu-security
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, parrot-menu (>= ${source:Version})
Description: Parrot GNU/Linux installable security launchers
 This package enables install-on-demand launchers for security tools that are
 available from the Parrot repositories but are not installed.
 .
 It does not install the security tools themselves. Launchers for tools already
 installed remain available without this package.
